### dahye의 인가 코드 받기
# @no-redirect
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

response_type=code&client_id=photo-app&redirect_uri=http://localhost:4002/callback&scope=photos&username=dahye&password=dahye1234&decision=allow

### jaehoon의 인가 코드 받기
# @no-redirect
POST http://127.0.0.1:4001/authorize
